# The Directory menu. Under a script CURDIR$ shows the folder the game started in as C:\CWB
# (SCRIPT.BM), so the menu looks the same in every folder. Esc leaves the menu. A folder that does
# not exist on the drive CURDIR$ names, C:\NO\SUCH\FOLDER, gives error 76, "PATH NOT FOUND", for
# a moment, and the main menu comes back. The text field starts with C:\CWB, which typing
# overwrites.
#! seed 4

# Directory, the eighth entry: seven down from Load File, which the menu highlights.
play until 2:M
repeat 6
key down
prompt
end
key enter
play until 4
digest
key esc

# Directory again: a folder that does not exist.
play until 2:M
digest
repeat 6
key down
prompt
end
key enter
play until 4
text C:\NO\SUCH\FOLDER
key enter
play until 2:M
digest

# Quit, Yes.
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
